{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The birds have caught your attention, their noise is tormenting\u2014it\u2019s time to scare them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Just a Little Purr suit</i> is a turn-based strategy puzzle game. <strong>20 handcrafted levels</strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>a fun adventure designed for the whole family! With no time limit, you can choose a direction and use cards to perform an available action within the level, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Common movement cards:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards that move the kitten forward by slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If in doubt, <strong>you can undo the action.</strong> The card will return to its initial position. Explore different solutions to the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Trampoline Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The direction cannot be chosen, but you can determine the distance. However, it will always move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The environment will challenge you! Boosters can either help or hinder you by changing your position.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412300?t=1744667728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744667728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412300/f1571b925eead642cf9e86ad6b695fc474bec8bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744667728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412300/f1571b925eead642cf9e86ad6b695fc474bec8bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744667728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The birds have caught your attention, their noise is tormenting\u2014it\u2019s time to scare them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Just a Little Purr suit</i> is a turn-based strategy puzzle game. <strong>20 handcrafted levels</strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>a fun adventure designed for the whole family! With no time limit, you can choose a direction and use cards to perform an available action within the level, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Common movement cards:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards that move the kitten forward by slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If in doubt, <strong>you can undo the action.</strong> The card will return to its initial position. Explore different solutions to the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Trampoline Card:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The direction cannot be chosen, but you can determine the distance. However, it will always move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The environment will challenge you! Boosters can either help or hinder you by changing your position.</p>","developers":["Wise Box Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3377720","name":"Just a Little Purr suit"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412300/header.jpg?t=1744667728","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Just a Little Purr suit Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Dual Core\u2122 2.1 Ghz+ or AMD Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card supporting DirectX 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></u